      "english": "Little Le was about to get married."
    },
    {
      "index": 4,
      "simplified": "“听说你要结婚了？”",
      "traditional": "“聽說你要結婚了？”",
      "pinyin": "tīng shuō nǐ yào jié hūn le",
      "english": "Suddenly she received a message from her first love boyfriend, who she hadn't talked to in a long time:"
    },
    {
      "index": 5,
      "simplified": "\n    ",
      "traditional": "\n    ",
      "pinyin": "",
      "english": "“I heard you're getting married?”"
    },
    {
      "index": 6,
      "simplified": "小乐脑海中闪过无数种想法，",
      "traditional": "小樂腦海中閃過無數種想法，",
      "pinyin": "xiǎo lè nǎo hǎi zhōng shǎn guò wú shù zhǒng xiǎng fǎ",
      "english": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 7,
      "simplified": "比如他还舍不得，他才发现最爱的是我，求你原谅我……之类的。",
      "traditional": "比如他還捨不得，他才發現最愛的是我，求你原諒我……之類的。",
      "pinyin": "bǐ rú tā hái shě bu de tā cái fā xiàn zuì ài de shì wǒ qiú nǐ yuán liàng wǒ zhī lèi de",
      "english": "Countless thoughts flashed by Little Le's mind."
    },
    {
      "index": 8,
      "simplified": "\n    ",
      "traditional": "\n    ",
      "pinyin": "",
      "english": "For example: he misses me, he finally realized I'm his true love, he wants to ask for forgiveness… etc."
    },
    {
      "index": 9,
      "simplified": "于是，小乐很骄傲地回了他前男友一句：“是啊！”",
      "traditional": "於是，小樂很驕傲地回了他前男友一句：“是啊！”",
      "pinyin": "yú shì xiǎo lè hěn jiāo ào de huí le tā qián nán yǒu yí jù shì a",
      "english": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 10,
      "simplified": "\n    ",
      "traditional": "\n    ",
      "pinyin": "",
      "english": "Thus, Little Le proudly replied to her old boyfriend: “That's right!”"
    },
    {
      "index": 11,
      "simplified": "没过几分钟，前男友又发来了一条信息：",
      "traditional": "沒過幾分鐘，前男友又發來了一條信息：",
      "pinyin": "méi guò jǐ fēn zhōng qián nán yǒu yòu fā lái le yì tiáo xìn xī",
      "english": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 12,
      "simplified": "“我开了家婚庆公司，中式欧式的都有，",
      "traditional": "“我開了家婚慶公司，中式歐式的都有，",
      "pinyin": "wǒ kāi le jiā hūn qìng gōng sī zhōng shì ōu shì de dōu yǒu",
      "english": "Within a few minutes, her old boyfriend sent another message:"
    },
    {
      "index": 13,
      "simplified": "老朋友打八折，要不要考虑一下？”",
      "traditional": "老朋友打八折，要不要考慮一下？”",
      "pinyin": "lǎo péng you dǎ bā zhé yào bú yào kǎo lǜ yí xià",
      "english": "“I've started a wedding company. We have both Chinese and Western style.”"
    }
